                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32857941-bdc1-3c39-822a-4122852c0dbc",
                        "entry_id": "037fc0f4-1b8c-3fd2-b1a1-7ab673c7f978",
                        "glosses": [
                            "sterke afkeer, tegenzin"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec062272-903d-487b-99b7-12560e31d865",
                                "sense_id": "32857941-bdc1-3c39-822a-4122852c0dbc",
                                "text": "Hij heeft een weerzin tegen alles wat daarmee te maken heeft."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "62d77193-c317-4007-8ed5-92a0433e493e",
                        "source_entry_id": "037fc0f4-1b8c-3fd2-b1a1-7ab673c7f978",
                        "source_sense_id": "32857941-bdc1-3c39-822a-4122852c0dbc",
                        "source_sense_description": "sterke afkeer",
                        "target_lang_word": "Widerwille",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Widerwille",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66346ae9-b882-335a-9854-c3e3979f9d16",
                                        "entry_id": "465119e0-84e4-3ba0-893f-9ba5756532ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Einstellung/Gefühl einer starken Abneigung gegen jemanden oder etwas"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e41a167-d759-42fb-9fe4-0efe9d2dd08b",
                                                "sense_id": "66346ae9-b882-335a-9854-c3e3979f9d16",
                                                "text": "„In diesem Augenblick fühlte er nichts anderes als einen unbestimmten Zorn, einen tiefen Widerwillen und den Beginn einer grenzenlosen Hoffnungslosigkeit.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4683c385-5f0b-40c3-ba52-8b951cdf2261",
                                                "sense_id": "66346ae9-b882-335a-9854-c3e3979f9d16",
                                                "text": "„Sie hatte sich bei der Arbeit niemals wohl gefühlt, aber jetzt trat zum Unbehagen plötzlich noch Widerwille hinzu.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "743e4064-8626-4897-a82e-44f12cf8a682",
                                                "sense_id": "66346ae9-b882-335a-9854-c3e3979f9d16",
                                                "text": "„Aber gerade in diesem Widerwillen gegen alles fand Pierre einen seltsam erregenden Reiz.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "097630bc-a125-4db5-8669-2ddd5a23adf9",
                                                "sense_id": "66346ae9-b882-335a-9854-c3e3979f9d16",
                                                "text": "„Ich tat es mit Widerwillen und stand Höllenqualen aus, nicht aus Verlangen, an seine Stelle zu treten, denn bei mir rührte sich nichts, sondern aus Wut darüber, daß sich eine so schöne Frau einem Mann hingab, der seinen einzigen Vorzug mit dem Esel gemeinsam hatte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6fe9681d-e9c1-49b9-ae6c-6a7a08eff87e",
                        "source_entry_id": "037fc0f4-1b8c-3fd2-b1a1-7ab673c7f978",
                        "source_sense_id": "32857941-bdc1-3c39-822a-4122852c0dbc",
                        "source_sense_description": "sterke afkeer",
                        "target_lang_word": "revulsion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "revulsion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf1a7ef5-1eb2-3fcb-9d2a-c1fd21340005",
                                        "entry_id": "b5fe982b-240b-37ff-89c2-73adc7c84a09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abhorrence, a sense of loathing, intense aversion, repugnance, repulsion, horror."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8c057d74-81d2-3044-9bbc-918eeafdddef",
                                        "entry_id": "b5fe982b-240b-37ff-89c2-73adc7c84a09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden violent feeling of disgust."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "404933d0-3bd2-37cd-9d21-3189b8c87328",
                                        "entry_id": "b5fe982b-240b-37ff-89c2-73adc7c84a09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The treatment of one diseased area by acting elsewhere; counterirritation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25c22eaf-99a3-3dfe-938e-3b78da86ef2c",
                                        "entry_id": "b5fe982b-240b-37ff-89c2-73adc7c84a09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A strong pulling or drawing back; withdrawal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7190eaf6-d9c2-4013-94a8-8aa64b50470d",
                                                "sense_id": "25c22eaf-99a3-3dfe-938e-3b78da86ef2c",
                                                "text": "To run on in deſpight of the Revulſions and Pul-backs of ſuch Remora’s aggravates our tranſgreſſions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32b40896-097f-494c-bbc1-13cdf376384f",
                                                "sense_id": "25c22eaf-99a3-3dfe-938e-3b78da86ef2c",
                                                "text": "The recent financial revulsion has revealed the feeble basis on which credit now stands, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c3b6b345-8d5b-3a98-8e79-4618597cb641",
                                        "entry_id": "b5fe982b-240b-37ff-89c2-73adc7c84a09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden reaction; a sudden and complete change of the feelings."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22b0cea7-e4fe-4ce5-97ac-eaa5eee17366",
                                                "sense_id": "c3b6b345-8d5b-3a98-8e79-4618597cb641",
                                                "text": "We resolve, and our resolutions melt away with a word and a look: we are the toys of an emotion. And yet I think Norbourne was right in his sudden revulsion in favour of his uncle. We are rarely wrong when we act from impulse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "96180a4f-47e6-4aa8-9c6f-b146db62db16",
                                                "sense_id": "c3b6b345-8d5b-3a98-8e79-4618597cb641",
                                                "text": "A sudden and violent revulsion of feeling, both in the parliament and in the country, followed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a91ed962-e28a-4a06-839f-6a0df9aedfd8",
                        "source_entry_id": "037fc0f4-1b8c-3fd2-b1a1-7ab673c7f978",
                        "source_sense_id": "32857941-bdc1-3c39-822a-4122852c0dbc",
                        "source_sense_description": "sterke afkeer",
                        "target_lang_word": "disgust",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "disgust",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "954a3684-0fee-3374-86e3-5412d73f36fc",
                                        "entry_id": "dbe037de-479d-3247-ae69-deb7a8e707fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause an intense dislike for something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d29b74f-85d8-4fb7-9b08-ff01667ea6d2",
                                                "sense_id": "954a3684-0fee-3374-86e3-5412d73f36fc",
                                                "text": "It disgusts me to see her chew with her mouth open."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65fd8c42-b8b2-4ec0-9142-b488cbfa50f4",
                                                "sense_id": "954a3684-0fee-3374-86e3-5412d73f36fc",
                                                "text": "Tuc[ca]. […] Can thy Author doe it impudently enough? / Hiſt[rio]. O, I warrant you, Captaine: and ſpitefully inough too; he ha's one of the moſt ouerflowing villanous wits, in Rome. He will ſlander any man that breathes; If he diſguſt him. / Tucca. I'le know the poor, egregious, nitty Raſcall; and he haue ſuch commendable Qualities, I'le cheriſh him: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c4df528-51da-4a0d-af0e-fadf09e11a6a",
                                                "sense_id": "954a3684-0fee-3374-86e3-5412d73f36fc",
                                                "text": "Mud This is a very specious piece of business; and above my implication—Dear me—dear me—what a thing it is, that one never can disgust one’s meals in peace—but one must be torn piecemeal with defamations—convocations—and other informalities—If I’d any of the fees and requisites of office for my pains—it would be a different thing—but every body knows I’m an ignoramous, and commit justice gratis—I must disperse the complaint."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fbd8aee-0860-481f-89d3-e011f510ab47",
                                                "sense_id": "954a3684-0fee-3374-86e3-5412d73f36fc",
                                                "text": "1874, Marcus Clarke, For the Term of His Natural Life Chapter V\nIt is impossible to convey, in words, any idea of the hideous phantasmagoria of shifting limbs and faces which moved through the evil-smelling twilight of this terrible prison-house. Callot might have drawn it, Dante might have suggested it, but a minute attempt to describe its horrors would but disgust."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "disgust",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7f1f533-596c-3c76-b3cd-57e066e5eafc",
                                        "entry_id": "69300267-907c-34be-90f1-343193572dc0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An intense dislike or loathing someone feels for something bad or nasty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f0c47f2-9c9f-4cb1-97e1-6989601ac8a0",
                                                "sense_id": "b7f1f533-596c-3c76-b3cd-57e066e5eafc",
                                                "text": "With an air of disgust, she stormed out of the room."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0c116570-9ef0-4574-86f6-db59ea4fdc40",
                        "source_entry_id": "037fc0f4-1b8c-3fd2-b1a1-7ab673c7f978",
                        "source_sense_id": "32857941-bdc1-3c39-822a-4122852c0dbc",
                        "source_sense_description": "sterke afkeer",
                        "target_lang_word": "aversion",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aversion",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "87668315-ed70-33fa-92a3-8d1f6a3afd8c",
                                        "entry_id": "39a572e2-6bd5-32a8-a80a-53504a3c9f5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Violente antipathie ; répugnance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1ade791-3ad4-45c2-92ed-90ce8c730525",
                                                "sense_id": "87668315-ed70-33fa-92a3-8d1f6a3afd8c",
                                                "text": "Le mépris où il tenait le nationalisme dont j'ai toujours eu l'aversion, le dédain qu'il témoignait pour les trémolos sur le grand air de patrie qui enchantaient le sentimentalisme alangui de mon cher Paul Deschanel achevèrent de m'attacher à lui."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62e4f777-eac9-4a75-8b54-08a5121d9f9e",
                                                "sense_id": "87668315-ed70-33fa-92a3-8d1f6a3afd8c",
                                                "text": "Un leitmotiv principal à travers son œuvre est sans aucun doute la grande aversion qu'il porte contre cette génération fondamentalement dégénérée de soixante-huitards."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f14b26a-b854-4152-be85-e70b10df6d43",
                                                "sense_id": "87668315-ed70-33fa-92a3-8d1f6a3afd8c",
                                                "text": "Son père, […], est surnommé « Camélinat le Rouge » pour ses convictions républicaines. Cet austère paysan a élevé ses enfants dans l’aversion de la monarchie, puis de l’Empire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b219eda-bfd8-4c95-97ab-cbadbe04b76b",
                                                "sense_id": "87668315-ed70-33fa-92a3-8d1f6a3afd8c",
                                                "text": "Le contraire de l'amour, ce n'est pas la haine, mais l'aversion. On peut tomber subitement amoureux d'une personne qu'on déteste, mais pas d'une personne qui nous répugne."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a25a9a12-0132-3c6d-ba0e-0cf4e5699252",
                                        "entry_id": "39a572e2-6bd5-32a8-a80a-53504a3c9f5b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Objet lui-même de cette forte antipathie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9dfd7fd6-853d-4f5e-8c89-bae77371f637",
                        "source_entry_id": "037fc0f4-1b8c-3fd2-b1a1-7ab673c7f978",
                        "source_sense_id": "32857941-bdc1-3c39-822a-4122852c0dbc",
                        "source_sense_description": "sterke afkeer",
                        "target_lang_word": "répugnance",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "répugnance",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d1f62ae2-3cd8-31ba-bbae-e2ce48f86bd2",
                                        "entry_id": "f78927c8-aca3-3f12-85f1-320fcf12b9fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Opposition naturelle, éloignement ou répulsion pour quelqu’un ou pour quelque chose."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "743684c0-c589-4226-a0d4-5dd99093d3bd",
                                                "sense_id": "d1f62ae2-3cd8-31ba-bbae-e2ce48f86bd2",
                                                "text": "Alors Athos tira de sa poche un petit papier sur lequel étaient écrites deux lignes accompagnées d’une signature et d’un sceau, et le présenta à celui qui donnait trop prématurément ces signes de répugnance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0000f741-1e5c-4492-b10a-20e8145feddd",
                                                "sense_id": "d1f62ae2-3cd8-31ba-bbae-e2ce48f86bd2",
                                                "text": "Ce fut donc le clergé qui, à Plassans, mena la réaction. La noblesse devint son prête-nom, rien de plus ; il se cacha derrière elle, il la gourmanda, la dirigea, parvint même à lui rendre une vie factice. Quand il l’eut amenée à vaincre ses répugnances au point de faire cause commune avec la bourgeoisie, il se crut certain de la victoire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bcbfb70a-38fe-44b1-a0b0-b4a0742b2caa",
                                                "sense_id": "d1f62ae2-3cd8-31ba-bbae-e2ce48f86bd2",
                                                "text": "L’iguane est un plat médiocre, disent les uns, cela sent le reptile. Mais si l'on peut vaincre sa répugnance, cela constitue un plat de résistance et qui vaut bien le singe rouge. Quant à moi, j'en suis très friand ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3dffe78-fedb-4abf-8145-0033419d4024",
                                                "sense_id": "d1f62ae2-3cd8-31ba-bbae-e2ce48f86bd2",
                                                "text": "Il est vrai, […], que le juifs, plus versés que les prêtres chrétiens dans la connaissance des Écritures, étaient de redoutables controversistes, à ce point que Saint Louis manifesta sa répugnance pour les discussions entre les juifs et les chrétiens insuffisamment instruits : […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d45a7b05-e12a-41fd-a1a5-8660ca6455b0",
                                                "sense_id": "d1f62ae2-3cd8-31ba-bbae-e2ce48f86bd2",
                                                "text": "Sa nuit de noce n'avait pas été pour elle une nuit d'amour. Elle avait subi son époux sans ardeur et sans répugnance."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7c6a1b3-82a1-4914-8204-6555e31967be",
                                                "sense_id": "d1f62ae2-3cd8-31ba-bbae-e2ce48f86bd2",
                                                "text": "Un problème d’incontinence peut ne pas être reconnu étant donné la répugnance de la personne à parler de quelque chose d’aussi privé et d’aussi intime que la fonction urinaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
